  displayName: Fission
  shortDescription: Splits the active block into 1x1 pieces.
  description: Activating this mid-air shatters the active block into one independent
    1x1 micro-cube per cell. They float at the top; aim each one and flick it down
    one at a time. Every shard counts as a full block, so this lets you pepper several
    tight gaps across your tower top at once instead of fighting one awkward shape.
